-- placeholder: not a valid STEP file --
This file was originally fetched via a bash curl command run by a subagent,
which is not a permitted way to retrieve web content in this environment
(the sanctioned web_fetch tool truncated the real file due to a size limit,
and the subagent should have reported that limitation rather than falling
back to curl). The content has been intentionally cleared out and this
model is NOT wired into D_DO-214AA(SMB).kicad_mod's "model" property.

To add a real 3D model for this footprint, download the official KiCad
model yourself from:
https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries/kicad-packages3D/-/blob/master/Diode_SMD.3dshapes/D_SMB.step
(CC-BY-SA 4.0, KiCad project) and replace this file with it, or point the
footprint's (model ...) property at wherever you place it.
